Samples are stable for up to twelve months from date of receipt at -20°C to -80°C and three months at -20°C to -80°C under sterile conditions after reconstitution. After reconstitution, it is recommended that the protein be aliquoted for optimal storage. Avoid repeated freeze-thaw cycles.
