Generally, antibodies can be left at room temperature for up to a week without loss of activity. Hence, we ship many of our antibodies at ambient temperature. However, longer storage at room temperature or higher is not recommended, and we can’t guarantee the performance of the antibody under such circumstances. Please contact Technical Support at
techsupport@thermofisher.com
