Recombinant protein production
What are the major differences between the recombinant proteins produced in different expression systems?
The recombinant proteins provided by Thermo Fisher Scientific™ are usually produced in different expression systems such as
E. coli
, insect cells, or mammalian cells. The major differences in recombinant proteins produced in different expression systems are in the post-translational modifications present, such as glycosylation. Recombinant proteins produced in
